# shared/darwin/os — operating systems tart-stacks builds on the darwin
# platform. One token per line; '#' comments and blank lines ignored.
# Unlike the linux tokens, "macos" doesn't map to a same-named published
# image — Cirrus publishes macOS per release, so Makefile's MACOS_RELEASE
# names that release separately.
# The platform that owns this file is its directory. shared/linux/os is its
# peer.
# There is deliberately no shared/darwin/desktops: the macOS desktop is
# intrinsic, so the platform has no DE axis.
macos
